#33	House of Worship
"You're in a magnificent seven-sided room with rows of pews in concentric
heptagons facing the center.  A door to the south is tightly closed.
A large, gnarled man is standing in the center of the room."
     name|who\ are\ you  m=\
"The man's face turns purple with effort as he answers,
\"My name is ...
my name is Ig...
Arrrrgh!  I cannot lie here, my name is ... J. Edgar Hoover Jr.!\""
     axolotyl  s=32.0  s=33.1  m=\
"\"Aha! I got Ignarp's secret message!\" says the man as he disappears."
     hit\ man  s=33.2  m=\
"As you battle with the man he undergoes an amazing metamorphosis into
a beautiful woman!  \"Ignarp's the handle\", she says,
\"thanks for distracting Hoover while I regained control.\""

